<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Q1 oil products exports jump 91 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Q1 oil products exports jump 91 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's oil products exports surged 91 percent to 55.6 million barrels in the first quarter of 1997 against 29.1 million barrels in the same period in 1996, the Ministry of Trade, Industry and Energy said on Monday.</p>
<p>The ministry said in a statement that sharp growth in oil products output and a slowdown in domestic consumption were responsible for the increase.</p>
<p>The nation's imports dropped by 29.6 percent to 55.0 million barrels in the first quarter from 78.1 million a year ago. The ministry did not give breakdown by each product.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
